## 10. Blank-screen prevention system

This is the most important upgrade.

The website must include:

Loading screen

Show a branded loading screen while application modules initialize.

Error boundary

If a component fails, show an error page instead of an entirely white screen.

Missing-file detection

Check critical resources and display useful diagnostic information.

Fallback interface

If AI services are unavailable, users should still be able to create websites using templates.

Network recovery

Provide retry controls when network requests fail.

Deployment monitoring

Check the actual published website after deployment, not just whether the build succeeded.

Example:

```
window.addEventListener("error", (event) => {
  console.error("Application error:", event.message);
});

window.addEventListener("unhandledrejection", (event) => {
  console.error("Async application error:", event.reason);
});
```

These handlers assist diagnosis; they must be combined with React error boundaries, logging and proper error recovery.

